Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, Firebase architect, UI/UX designer, security engineer and product designer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, production-oriented e-commerce platform for selling my JEE preparation handbook, called **DIAMOND JEE HANDBOOK**.

